@startuml 08-batch-states
' DOC-07 §7.7 — Batch lifecycle state machine (FR-07, AC-07.2)
hide empty description
title Batch lifecycle (batch.status)

[*] --> queued : POST /batches accepted\n(file valid)
queued --> processing : worker picks job
queued --> cancelled : user cancels (Could)
processing --> completed : all chunks predicted,\nstats computed
processing --> failed : chunk failed after 3 retries\nor file cannot be parsed
processing --> cancelled : user cancels (Could)
failed --> queued : user re-submits (Could)
completed --> [*] : deleted by user\nor retention job
failed --> [*] : deleted by user\nor retention job
cancelled --> [*] : deleted by user\nor retention job

note right of processing
  progress = processed_count / total_count
  partial predictions remain readable
end note
@enduml
